								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Mythical Miscreants.&nbsp; Dead and buried for years now.&nbsp; It&#039;s funny, I don&#039;t think you ever can have as much fun as you did with your first family-type guild.&nbsp; Any given night, the whole guild pretty much hung out together.&nbsp; Epic mobs like Phinny and VS were the highlight of our raid experience.
