							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Can&#039;t remember the name now, it was an evil only guild that had there first meeting in the freeport sewers. I was a dwarf, but a cleric so they let me in since my rl brother was a troll.<br /><br />My condition of enterance: I had to act &quot;evil&quot;<br /><br />Shortly after that, Kendolin (the warrior) gave me his account and I joined Arctos.
