	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg13776"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=648" title="View the profile of Ilona">Ilona</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 11<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=648"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1380.msg13776#msg13776"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1380.msg13776#msg13776">Re: What was your first guild?</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #11 on:</b> January 19, 2005, 03:11:13 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Crusaders of Tunare here as well!&nbsp; I joined at the grand old age of level 8, and went on my first raid (to Najena) at level 13... was supposed to be lvl 15+ for that raid, but me and two others stayed near the entrance and messed about!&nbsp; I still chat to a couple of people from there when I see them!<br /><br />Was then in Noble Crusaders for a while, but never saw anybody online.<br /><br />Sovereign Prodigy now... though many have left for EQ2 we still have fun!
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
